## CI/CD pipeline

The CI/CD pipeline automates:

* Build
* Unit tests
* Integration tests
* Security scanning
* AI evaluation
* Infrastructure validation
* Deployment
* Smoke tests
* Rollback

Artifacts that should go through CI/CD include:

